profile: runtime-mirust.retired-redirect-index.v1
updated_utc: 2026-07-02T00:00:00Z

status:
  Runtime.MiRust.com is retired as a separate documentation authority.
  This repository now carries a redirect-only package for the runtime.mirust.com web root.

canonical_routes:
  developer_portal: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/developer-portal/
  current_app: https://tinyrustlm.com/
  preserved_archive: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/runtime-portal/index.md
  archive_manifest: https://tinyrustlm.mirust.com/docs/runtime-portal/MANIFEST.md

read_order:
  - workspace.uai
  - README.md
  - DEPLOYMENT.md
  - PACKAGE-MANIFEST.md
  - .uai/long-term-memory.uai
  - .uai/runtime-mirust-site-memory.uai
  - .uai/exports/llms.uai
  - .uai/exports/llms-full.uai

rules:
  - Do not treat Runtime.MiRust.com as current authority.
  - Do not deploy using the FileZilla profile currently named Runtime.MiRust.com; it points to TinyRustLM.MiRust.com.
  - Deploy only to a verified runtime.mirust.com web root.
  - Preserve old implementation memory through TinyRustLM.MiRust.com/docs/runtime-portal/.
